From 9bc8cd8427a5aa9bf8976acaef4426ce09a08537 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koundinya Goparaju <koundinya.goparaju@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:57:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] onscreen/native: Check the CRTC GPU's copy mode for zero-copy
 surfaces
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Since commit 8003d680, create_bos_gbm() only looks up the CRTC's
primary plane for surfaces that aren't sharable. Sharable surfaces get
the first entry of default_formats, ARGB2101010, even when the buffer
will be scanned out directly on the secondary GPU through zero-copy.
evdi (DisplayLink) planes don't support that format, so the atomic
commit fails and the monitor stays black.

Also look up the primary plane when the GPU driving the CRTC uses
zero-copy, so the format is limited to what that plane supports.

The copy mode has to come from the CRTC's GPU. renderer_gpu_data here
belongs to the render GPU, and its copy mode is SECONDARY_GPU whenever
it could act as a secondary GPU itself.

Based on a test patch by Michel Dänzer.

Fixes: 8003d6806a ("onscreen/native: Choose GBM format directly for FBO path")
Closes: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/5100
Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/5372>
---
 src/backends/native/meta-onscreen-native.c | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/backends/native/meta-onscreen-native.c b/src/backends/native/meta-onscreen-native.c
index 7297ab1da5f..d8dd12fd1c1 100644
--- a/src/backends/native/meta-onscreen-native.c
+++ b/src/backends/native/meta-onscreen-native.c
@@ -2720,6 +2720,7 @@ create_bos_gbm (CoglOnscreen  *onscreen,
     meta_renderer_egl_get_renderer_gpu_data (META_RENDERER_EGL (cogl_renderer));
   MetaCrtcKms *crtc_kms = META_CRTC_KMS (onscreen_native->crtc);
   MetaKmsPlane *kms_plane = NULL;
+  MetaRendererNativeGpuData *crtc_gpu_data = NULL;
   uint32_t gbm_flags = GBM_BO_USE_RENDERING;
   size_t num_bos = G_N_ELEMENTS (onscreen_native->gbm.bos);
   MetaRenderDevice *render_device;
@@ -2733,7 +2734,18 @@ create_bos_gbm (CoglOnscreen  *onscreen,
   int i;
 
   should_be_sharable = should_surface_be_sharable (onscreen);
-  if (!should_be_sharable)
+  if (should_be_sharable)
+    {
+      MetaGpu *crtc_gpu = meta_crtc_get_gpu (onscreen_native->crtc);
+
+      crtc_gpu_data =
+        meta_renderer_native_get_gpu_data (renderer_native,
+                                           META_GPU_KMS (crtc_gpu));
+    }
+
+  if (!should_be_sharable ||
+      crtc_gpu_data->secondary.copy_mode ==
+      META_SHARED_FRAMEBUFFER_COPY_MODE_ZERO)
     {
       kms_plane = meta_crtc_kms_get_assigned_primary_plane (crtc_kms);
       gbm_flags |= GBM_BO_USE_SCANOUT;
-- 
